        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "**What is Shadow?**\n\nShadow is an advanced Jailbreak Detection Bypass tweak. It prevents apps from detecting that the device is jailbroken using various hooking methods.\n\n**What this translation includes:**\n- Full translation of the main settings screen\n- Translation of all bypass / hook options\n- About screen translation\n- Per-app settings translation\n\n**How to use:**\n1. Make sure Shadow is installed\n2. Install this localization package\n3. Respring\n4. Go to Settings → Shadow — everything will appear in Hebrew",
